  "painter": "mix",
  "note": "Midnight navy with gold star inlays and a starfield drifting along the cue: a starry navy shaft with gold swooshes into the joint, a gold four-point star with gold arcs on the forearm and on the sleeve (OpenAI), a navy snakeskin wrap, gold ring lines, a silver collar.",
  "ai": {
    "forearm": {
      "refs": [
        "closeup",
        "full"
      ],
      "roll_deg": 45,
      "prompt": "The forearm is deep midnight navy (#0B1440) like a night sky, sprinkled with tiny white and gold star specks and a faint deep-blue nebula haze. Its centrepiece, on the middle row about 60 percent of the way from left to right: a gold four-point compass star (#FFD76A) about 200 pixels tall, with a smaller diagonal four-point star behind it, bright pale gold at its centre. Thin elegant gold lines sweep in long curved arcs across the forearm from the left and wrap round the star like a comet path. The two thin strips at the far left are the joint collar: paint them plain flat silver (#C8CCD0)."
    },
    "butt": {
      "refs": [
        "closeup",
        "full"
      ],
      "roll_deg": 45,
      "prompt": "Left thin strip (the ring): navy (#0B1440) with two thin gold lines (#FFD76A). The wrap (from the ring to the next zone line): plain flat navy blue (#14204E). The butt sleeve (between the two zone lines on the right): deep midnight navy with tiny white and gold star specks, a gold four-point compass star (#FFD76A) about 150 pixels tall on the middle row, framed on both sides by thin gold arcs that curve like a pointed oval round it. The very thin strip at the far right: plain black."
    }
  },
